# Push to all

When the user asks to **push to all**, after committing (if needed), push the current commit to all of these remotes/branches:

1. `origin` `main`
2. `origin` `test` (e.g. `git push origin main:test`)
3. `helix-admin1` `main`
4. `helix-admin1` `test` (e.g. `git push helix-admin1 main:test`)

Always include `helix-admin1/test` — do not stop at `helix-admin1/main` alone.
